# build/screensavers-version.env -- single source of truth for the ncz-screensavers
# version floor enforced by:
#   post-install/59-ncz-screensavers-pkg.sh       (the install hook, runtime)
#   build/build-desktop-mirror.sh                 (the offline-mirror pool)
#   build/build-squashfs-layers.sh                (pre-flight: required in pool)
#   build/build-role-delta-mkosi.sh               (pre-flight: required in pool)
#   build/test-screensavers-mandatory-install.sh  (fail-before/pass-after gate)
#   build/verify-installed-target.sh              (the post-install assertion)
#
# Raise the floor here in ONE commit; every consumer reads it through the same
# helper.
#
# 0.8.16 UPDATE (2026-10-14): the floor is raised to 0.8.16. 0.8.14 made the
# lock-hosted saver keep animating until input raises the unlock prompt (freeze
# mode "prompt", no 15 s timer: on NCZ-OS the lock hosts the idle saver, so the
# old timer froze every idle screensaver), rendered framebuffer-0 savers
# (classics post-processing, Magmasimplex) off-screen instead of black, and
# fixed Magmasimplex on Mali. 0.8.15 adds: ncz-screensaver-idled honours the
# Singularity "Lock on Suspend" setting and leaves the lock before sleep to a
# shell that holds its own sleep inhibitor (shell patch 0022), so resume shows
# one lock screen. Compiled-in policy: lock_fps=8, render_div=2, freeze=prompt,
# freeze_after_s=15 (opt-in timer only), battery_lock_fps=6; the image gate
# requires freeze=prompt. 0.8.16 is locally staged (build/ncz-screensavers-out/)
# and publication is pending; 0.8.14 and 0.8.15 are PUBLISHED to the NCZ
# Buildkite Packages apt repo and mirrored to Cloudflare R2 (publish-first
# rule); older versions stay in the apt index as history.
#
# 0.8.17 UPDATE (2026-10-26): the floor is raised to 0.8.17. Fractasia now
# declares GLSL ES 3.00 (0.8.16 shipped "#version 320 es", which Mali -- ES 3.1
# -- refuses, so Fractasia drew black on Sky1), Black Hole is capped at 720
# render lines on Sky1, and Magmasimplex defaults to the realistic look.
# Source 5498abc8 (tag v0.8.17), built natively in debian:forky at the release
# snapshot on both arches. It is in the build-inputs store only: publication
# to the public apt repo waits on the operator, so the publish-first rule
# below is NOT yet satisfied for 0.8.17.
#
#
# 0.8.18 UPDATE (2026-10-27): the floor is raised to 0.8.18. The Black Hole
# renderer gains the four scientific-handoff stages: deterministic viewing
# geometry (disk-inclination, disk-position-angle, disk-tilt,
# spin-axis-inclination, spin-axis-position-angle), a selectable accretion-flow
# geometry (flow = disk, torus, riaf, spherical; flow-extent), Doppler modes and
# separately aimed jets (doppler on/off/cinematic, doppler-shift, jet-axis,
# jet-opening, jet-asymmetry), a low-emission lens mode (disk-emission, dark-lens
# preset) and opt-in turbulence. disk-emission gates every accretion emission
# path, including the tidal-disruption stream and its opacity. New presets:
# dark-lens, riaf, thick-torus, m87-jet, no-doppler. Source
# 07333ce64ac766c7b7b01c24017323cecff6708e (release/0.8.18-20261027), built
# natively in debian:forky on ACHILLES (amd64) and ULTRA (arm64); the arm64 deb
# is byte-identical when rebuilt under emulation on the other host. It is in the
# build-inputs store only: publication to the public apt repo waits on the
# operator, so the publish-first rule below is NOT yet satisfied for 0.8.18.

# 2026-10-15 NOTE: 0.8.16's source was repinned to the accepted saver source
# a7fe5cd4ed3b3c90c74fd5efd990e922c37de5ca (wip/studio/2026-10-14-t2-perf;
# jet cadence fix 9d8 + cadence-classification correction) and the engine
# was rebuilt both arches as native (bedad82ca.../35ad90ba...). The version
# floor stays 0.8.16 and is unchanged; the GTK4 reference binary (ref26bd4a3,
# 42340 bytes) is also unchanged and stays excluded from the NCZ image
# default. The plugin (NCZ_SSPLUGIN_VERSION, see post-install/lib/ncz-screensavers-plugin.lock)
# and the libsingularity payload stay on the actual 0.3.23 source 8f8433c4f
# against builder 291821e21f168e5f980d9b2f4954fea62594a20a -- only the
# engine rows migrate to A7.
#
# The publish-first / bump-second invariant is a standing
# rule (2026-10-11): every package/asset an image depends on MUST be
# published to the NCZ Buildkite Packages apt repo BEFORE the image
# that needs it is built.

# Minimum version the image must carry. Read by sourcing the file; compared with
# dpkg --compare-versions.
NCZ_SCREENSAVERS_MIN_VERSION=0.8.18

# Hard error message used everywhere the floor is violated. Keep it identical
# so operator logs are easy to scan for the same failure class.
NCZ_SCREENSAVERS_MISSING_MSG="ncz-screensavers is mandatory on desktop images; it is NOT in the offline mirror or has no candidate. Policy 2026-10-05: 'If we are distributing screensavers as Deb they need to be apt installed during installation.' Re-publish the package (oc-apt-publish) and rebuild the offline mirror."
NCZ_SCREENSAVERS_TOO_OLD_MSG="ncz-screensavers is too old for this image. The required minimum is in build/screensavers-version.env (NCZ_SCREENSAVERS_MIN_VERSION); rebuild with a newer published deb."

# Required product metadata inside the package's Published field. ncz-screensavers
# is published by Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>; we assert it to reject a
# mirrored wrong-source package.
NCZ_SCREENSAVERS_REQUIRED_MAINTAINER="Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>"
